<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90F_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20221214__20221214_z58liMsHIXD2"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-12-14to2022-12-14" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

